{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8ac623214632d25176eb455b7fb106246f3fed6f63ac7b6e6a04baf28189b6dd", "ja": "（様々なアイドルが出演するライブイベント、アイドル\nフェス。その出演者は、オーディションで決まる）", "zh": "（偶像嘉年华是一场有各种偶像出演的现场活动。出演者将通过试镜决定）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1001_p", "source_sha256": "995f8fc6595b12011fda56f34f424b5f677498d7d1d3e71889f0a5ef441edcf0", "ja": "（今回、765プロからは伊織、可奈、可憐、律子、\n響の5人が挑戦。見事に合格した！）", "zh": "（这次，765事务所由伊织、可奈、可怜、律子和响这5人参加挑战。结果顺利通过了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d64a548ef0c5638e9f31e0f2d1794d60aefcb245548660e984cde67f0906810f", "ja": "（伊織はソロでも選ばれているため、\n今日はみんなを代表して、記者会見に出る予定だ）", "zh": "（因为伊织还被选为了个人参赛者，所以今天预定由她代表大家出席记者会。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1003_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1004_p", "source_sha256": "be0e3ddaa659307ceb9d9f141bfa9c49f2965beea48c1d25e8912d078ad60264", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\n伊織、そろそろ会場に向かう時間だけど……", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n伊织，差不多该去会场了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "ab68bdfafd4d2a4dc2f6a9e9dc296a48c10982e2fc2e136154041cda41107f7f", "ja": "あら、もうそんな時間？\nすぐ行くわ。", "zh": "哎呀，已经到这个时间了？\n我马上就去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "ea71bea9d7da21bc954f913284b4ee66bad6c4c0dc4192f7e2be286c55dae394", "ja": "いってらっしゃい！\n伊織、緊張してないみたいね。安心したわ。", "zh": "慢走！\n伊织好像没那么紧张呢。这样我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "22b77896b06ac9859ddb30aa6f261fac259c4abc26fc4d18ad86ef6e3c0ce014", "ja": "ふふん、当然よ♪　\n記者会見くらい、軽くこなしちゃうんだから。", "zh": "哼哼，那当然啦♪  \n区区记者会，我当然能轻松应付。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "f2d35dd18a701e35d21213af5930d9e1143832d4c2d85753121aaa9e658a16ad", "ja": "いいなー、伊織。\n自分も記者会見出たかったぞ！", "zh": "真好啊，伊织。  \n我也想参加记者招待会来着！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f7018ca4d86e4472468e7ffc876425657ad38a6a2d95e8bbaa8d1f67e5c80c1d", "ja": "次また頑張ろうな！\nそれじゃ伊織、そろそろ出発しようか。", "zh": "下次再努力吧！\n那么伊织，我们差不多该出发了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1011_journalist", "source_sha256": "7d1f61d1c22e172a64f1d11cd1ec7a8a6135623db54d6e557d5d3eecc6a7774d", "ja": "……続きまして、765プロを代表して水瀬伊織さん。\n今回の意気込みなどお聞かせください！", "zh": "……接下来，请765事务所的代表水濑伊织，\n谈谈这次的决心和抱负吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "20d90e60c8dc0278818ed57975cb93a82bb7f0cfc9c6b4b229c29e0c64abc1be", "ja": "はい！　765プロの水瀬伊織です。今回、\nソロステージも担当させていただきます！", "zh": "好的！我是765事务所的水濑伊织。这次也将负责个人舞台的演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "96c87617683e66066d555f8af4b427d153689290397485ddc59409790d47c82b", "ja": "当日はみんなと一緒に、一生懸命頑張ります。\n応援、よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "当天我会和大家一起全力以赴的。\n请多多为我们加油哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1014_journalist", "source_sha256": "006f194ab1ba4de7e5740ffbe91a7986d0a2ae3790114204f537e20a31f3c5df", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nでは続いての質問ですが……。", "zh": "谢谢！  \n那么接下来是下一个问题……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1015_null", "source_sha256": "a7f5331a79549d81514da204d548b27a6692393f2961b6edc48d32d6f41e114a", "ja": "記者会見終了後……", "zh": "记者会结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a42e7b62abea0475b5b15eb56828a6306425447bcd1a84db880ea15461ab8327", "ja": "（記者会見は無事終了。次は決起集会という名の\nパーティーで、スポンサー方への挨拶回りだ）", "zh": "（记者会顺利结束。接下来要参加名为誓师会的派对，去向各位赞助商打招呼。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ada0518ad0274f3e151a131d789798489ebb6aad05368929451b85fabcc19e4c", "ja": "（伊織はこういうパーティーに慣れてそうだから、\n心配していないけど……なんだかこっちが緊張するな）", "zh": "（伊织似乎很习惯参加这种聚会，所以我倒是不担心……可不知怎么的，反而是我紧张起来了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "6a2b4efd9dc6ed34308009c2278967454f8e8738e1ce984f6adac133f29ddb7f", "ja": "初めまして、水瀬伊織です。\nよろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "初次见面，我是水濑伊织。\n请多关照♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1019_sponsor", "source_sha256": "c66305d75394b3664b12738314aaed1b3f3c34acd0174f825a31374714f36a08", "ja": "これはこれはご丁寧に！\nそうですか……あなたが噂の。", "zh": "哎呀，真是太周到了！\n这样啊……你就是传闻中的那位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "faea716ae5dacf81b25f0fddc4370e39b746373e5cb93023e8d044225331a110", "ja": "噂の……ですか？", "zh": "传闻中的……是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1021_sponsor", "source_sha256": "7c0ae6a1b5dd8e840d260e107f81943424b4eecf4dfd3711f1c28bf49c0e6eb7", "ja": "実は、今回スポンサーを務めているA社の会長から、\n水瀬さんのお話を色々伺っていましてね……。", "zh": "其实，我们从担任本次赞助商的A公司会长那里，\n听说了不少关于水濑小姐的事呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1022_sponsor", "source_sha256": "74ecc3aa0fa71ee8e5f05888040d9dc56eb3f7117a393bb2c9ca8569c4d796c8", "ja": "あ、あちらにいらっしゃるのが、\nそのA社の会長ですよ。", "zh": "啊，那边的就是A公司的董事长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "5292000ddaa08fad3df439cc11953ba8341e155545a1907eb1e67a7c243c010c", "ja": "は、はい……ありがとうございます！\nご挨拶に伺ってみます。", "zh": "是、是……谢谢您！\n我这就去打个招呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1024_p", "source_sha256": "35a0502031629fd98b97efcf5ca55e8bdb50e4908e319ca0977c92e5c86b1489", "ja": "A社……大手通信系企業だな。\n伊織、以前に仕事で関わった事があったか？", "zh": "A社……是大型通信类企业啊。\n伊织，你以前在工作中和他们有过交集吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "356b002727a3d5dada73d710a38824025199c189339350d43005b1facde86078", "ja": "……いいえ、ないと思うわ。\nでも……もしかしたら……。", "zh": "……没有，应该没有。\n不过……说不定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1026_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "40e7e11866b16973e82f050a84a08a297e142f543db7886d35005b1744d97107", "ja": "なんでもないわ。\nとにかく、行きましょ！", "zh": "没什么。\n总之，我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1028_p", "source_sha256": "d5453c8fb8f5541071f0bca19ee49dc69febfdddf678929790ae6555ac0101c4", "ja": "失礼します、765プロです。\nA社の会長さんは……。", "zh": "打扰了，我是765事务所的。\n请问A公司的会长在吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1029_chairman", "source_sha256": "35ad919dee81898440ec3b01df10d795bafe3012c29ca271de1cc37e5a0a32cd", "ja": "ああ、765プロダクションさん！　ちょうど\nよかった、後で声をかけようと思っていたんだよ。", "zh": "啊，765制作公司！正好，  \n我正想着之后去找你说话呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1030_p", "source_sha256": "120c35a381e3910ec75c29484ffda3d6770dff6a68d3a418fd3f35ff69be09f5", "ja": "そうでしたか。私、765プロダクションの\n{$P$}と申します。こちらが……", "zh": "原来如此。我是765制作公司的{$P$}。这位是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1031_007ior", "source_sha256": "7d74a9a4d918b0b5e6511b58abd857a0b6a7c56c4fc60e42ac304d35ec68883f", "ja": "初めまして、水瀬伊織です。\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "初次见面，我是水濑伊织。\n请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1032_chairman", "source_sha256": "fcb6f6ff28617c4a94ab92be07bebb0abdfa29ab374d6fa110f53f546d15a65a", "ja": "おおっ、ご丁寧にどうも。\n実は、君の事は以前からずっと応援していてね。", "zh": "哦，真是太客气了，谢谢你。\n其实，我一直以来都在支持你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1033_chairman", "source_sha256": "db732a929d98a68767a130344b4254b3b2e3beebb8e5233cb19df4903c110e72", "ja": "会社の人間からも、伊織さんはアイドルとして\nとても人気があるのだと聞いているよ。", "zh": "公司里的人也告诉过我，伊织作为偶像\n非常受欢迎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1034_007ior", "source_sha256": "17d9a089a5ebe5675c5cfbcdfba99e0fb904c7e2b0ca65d6041e6fe9604ae723", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます！\nそんなふうに仰っていただけて、光栄です。", "zh": "啊，非常感谢！\n您能这样说，我感到十分荣幸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1035_chairman", "source_sha256": "b9a5570d5fdce8dbb277d670e42db368e707ae9ecb6e8d5443b10f0d0866302b", "ja": "流石、水瀬家のご令嬢といったところか！\nお父さんやお兄さんも、さぞ鼻が高いだろうね。", "zh": "不愧是水濑家的千金啊！\n你父亲和哥哥一定也很为你感到自豪吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1036_007ior", "source_sha256": "7d71e4270fbe73ba286d1eaf0f0b764fb6621950c3254f7dde2f7bbf6996e192", "ja": "っ……！\nち、父と兄をご存じなんですか……？", "zh": "呃……！\n您、您认识我的父亲和哥哥吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1037_chairman", "source_sha256": "afcc36d1bab27746f003bd5fed97ebf02d5e6bbaccd351c96be3bdbeb7803b22", "ja": "もちろん！　君がまだ小さい頃、\nこういうパーティーで会った事もあるんだよ。", "zh": "当然！你还小的时候，我们也曾在这样的派对上见过面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1038_chairman", "source_sha256": "05bc8e247c1e1d4ddc5da364e5d97961b314a4e5c20880993807a8e70ab27096", "ja": "あの時の小さなお嬢さんが、立派になって……。", "zh": "当年的那个小姑娘，如今也出落得亭亭玉立了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1039_chairman", "source_sha256": "23bb022e4f6823a84a07e70c55aee9f2c7f234a988a90fa4b29716c1c4c08472", "ja": "何しろ水瀬家のお嬢さんだ、グループの\n総力を挙げて応援しないとね。期待してくれたまえ！", "zh": "毕竟是水濑家的大小姐，得举集团之力为她加油才行。敬请期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1041_p", "source_sha256": "2dd3f632a2424624ff7a5df33f00204148189f1b1c4b3f25361c27c6ce86a548", "ja": "（会長さんに悪意はないのかもしれないけど、\nこの話の流れはまずいな。話の流れを変えないと……）", "zh": "（会长先生或许并没有恶意，但这个话题的发展不太妙。得想办法改变话题的走向才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1042_007ior", "source_sha256": "b8759774f2c4e4e4e5bcf0b32af158f12ee5b3559384a1f10476439137cad5d0", "ja": "……ええ、そうですね！　家族も期待してくれていると\n思いますので、当日は精いっぱい頑張ります♪", "zh": "……嗯，是啊！我想家里人应该也\n对我抱有期待，所以当天我会全力以赴的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1043_chairman", "source_sha256": "cfc2ed4a50777ba60d6734322b28a82850eaf627381e026169777f58caddd3ad", "ja": "おお！　流石、頼もしい返事だね！", "zh": "哦！不愧是你，回答真让人安心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1044_hisho", "source_sha256": "e9a79b69972eed01baf7f4bc40cb8d0baa9ab209a58d3c1784720c8896ab9970", "ja": "ご歓談中失礼します。\n……会長、そろそろお時間が……。", "zh": "打扰一下各位的闲谈。\n……会长，差不多到时间了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1045_chairman", "source_sha256": "aab29c289e2a0467a28130d9874d382ee38d1c74d5b3ed8920beb5da35059288", "ja": "む、そうか。それじゃあ私はこの辺で失礼するよ。\nお父さんやお兄さんによろしく！", "zh": "唔，这样啊。那我差不多该告辞了。\n替我向你的父亲和哥哥问好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1046_007ior", "source_sha256": "a5bf8c051fb767cd03f4bd19fe2dadae6a9f425a0edfaa5edd727642ae959182", "ja": "はい！\n……ふぅ……。", "zh": "好的！\n……呼……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1047_p", "source_sha256": "e42dade97c0e5787e174f3e7c3e132981ca80a4e7b28b621149d8913145a1971", "ja": "伊織……大丈夫か？\n少し休憩しても……。", "zh": "伊织……没事吧？\n稍微休息一下也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1048_007ior", "source_sha256": "a12a2c20be26f91b225fe5a9693c80828b212772511c6c5e0dc4b0f926ce57af", "ja": "何よ、こんなのいつものことでしょ？　それに、\n挨拶しなきゃいけない人はまだまだいるんだから。", "zh": "什么嘛，这种事不是一向如此吗？而且，还有很多必须去打招呼的人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_131_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_131_1049_007ior", "source_sha256": "ec4f30dcfc705e4c58cc2484b644d7a5f7043f602a4ec96c84c8c71999c6b720", "ja": "ほら、さっさと次行くわよ！", "zh": "快点，赶紧去下一个地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
